268
00:15:17,967 --> 00:15:19,600
- Oh, you watched that?
- Yeah.

269
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:22,233
Man, he really lucked out
with his wife. Seriously.

270
00:15:22,233 --> 00:15:23,633
