- Yeah.

271
00:15:23,633 --> 00:15:25,567
No one's living the easy life like you, man.

272
00:15:25,567 --> 00:15:28,033
Man, I'm honestly
the most jealous of your life.

273
00:15:28,033 --> 00:15:30,600
Come on, jealous?
I'm the one who's jealous of you.

274
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,867
I heard you passed
five million followers this time?

275
00:15:32,867 --> 00:15:36,667
Come on. That stuff really means nothing.

276
00:15:36,667 --> 00:15:39,100
The best life is making good money
without being famous.

277
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:41,033
- Exactly.
- Seriously.

278
00:15:41,033 --> 00:15:42,833
- Right, right, right. That's the truth.
- Right, isn't it?

279
00:15:42,833 --> 00:15:44,133
We'll shoot the 4th take.

280
00:15:44,133 --> 00:15:45,833
Figure it out yourself.

281
00:15:45,833 --> 00:15:47,733
That's a painful truth.

282
00:15:49,567 --> 00:15:51,200
That's the thing about fame, really.

283
00:15:51,200 --> 00:15:55,733
Look, even when he wears a mask,
