379
00:21:22,833 --> 00:21:24,700
That's what she always calls me.

380
00:21:25,367 --> 00:21:28,533
No, that's actually cute.
It sounds like a nickname.

381
00:21:28,533 --> 00:21:30,600
It is a nickname.

382
00:21:30,600 --> 00:21:34,600
Now I see why you two
have such a great relationship.

383
00:21:34,600 --> 00:21:38,833
People joke that more than half
