384
00:21:38,833 --> 00:21:40,167
I'm jealous.

385
00:21:40,167 --> 00:21:42,533
Ye Ji's father is, how should I say...

386
00:21:42,533 --> 00:21:47,300
He has this youthful charm,
and he's so handsome.

387
00:21:47,300 --> 00:21:51,733
- Oh, not at all.
- Right, Hong does have a youthful charm.

388
00:21:51,733 --> 00:21:54,633
The problem is his mental age
is youthful too.

389
00:21:54,633 --> 00:21:56,533
Seriously, there you go again.

390
00:21:56,533 --> 00:22:00,367
Come on, if he were immature,
would he have ended up with someone like you?

391
00:22:00,367 --> 00:22:03,533
Men usually like young
and pretty women, right?

392
00:22:03,533 --> 00:22:06,833
Right? That's what I mean.

393
00:22:06,833 --> 00:22:08,467
Jeez.

394
00:22:09,167 --> 00:22:10,467
Oh, right.

395
00:22:10,467 --> 00:22:12,867
