397
00:22:17,700 --> 00:22:19,500
Really?

398
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:23,533
Oh, right, Ms. Ryu Ji Su
was praising Ye Ji's dad a lot.

399
00:22:23,533 --> 00:22:26,567
You two must be pretty close.

400
00:22:26,567 --> 00:22:28,433
Yes, well, we've known
each other for a long time.

401
00:22:28,433 --> 00:22:30,933
- Right, they've worked on a lot of projects.
- That's right.

402
00:22:30,933 --> 00:22:33,800
Oh, and I saw Tae Han recently too.

403
00:22:33,800 --> 00:22:36,633
His face looked so lifted and refreshed.

404
00:22:37,267 --> 00:22:39,900
Well, didn't Ahn Ji Min and Song Seok Gu say
they were going to tell

405
00:22:39,900 --> 00:22:41,733
