406
00:22:41,733 --> 00:22:44,500
Right, right. Her skills must be really good.

407
00:22:44,500 --> 00:22:47,867
You know you're really amazing,
Director, right?

408
00:22:47,867 --> 00:22:51,733
How did you manage to build your clinic
into something so successful?

409
00:22:52,600 --> 00:22:56,800
I run a company too,
and I know it's not easy at all.

410
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:59,700
Running a hospital is really...

411
00:22:59,700 --> 00:23:03,200
It wasn't easy suddenly doing it alone.

412
00:23:11,100 --> 00:23:16,400
Anyway, thank you for helping me
in so many ways.

413
00:23:16,400 --> 00:23:18,867
Don't mention it.

414
00:23:18,867 --> 00:23:21,567
Neighbors should help each other out.

415
00:23:21,567 --> 00:23:23,333
Mutually.

416
00:23:24,033 --> 00:23:27,400
Mutually, that's right.

417
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:31,933
If you two ever need anything,
