420
00:23:45,800 --> 00:23:48,733
Oh, by any chance,
among the people you know...

421
00:23:48,733 --> 00:23:51,767
Of course,
within the limits of what I can do.

422
00:23:51,767 --> 00:23:55,133
Sometimes people ask me to get them

423
00:23:55,133 --> 00:23:57,467
