can put me in an awkward position.

426
00:24:03,933 --> 00:24:05,367
Just in case...

427
00:24:05,367 --> 00:24:10,833
Of course, I know now that
you two aren't like that.

428
00:24:10,833 --> 00:24:12,633
- You understand, right?
- Of course.

429
00:24:12,633 --> 00:24:14,867
- We understand.
- Absolutely.

430
00:24:18,667 --> 00:24:21,433
- Honey, do you want another glass of wine?
- Sure.

431
00:24:21,433 --> 00:24:25,100
But this house really feels
like an art gallery, right, honey?

432
00:24:25,100 --> 00:24:27,867
Yeah, wow. I really love it.

433
00:24:27,867 --> 00:24:29,667
Look at the photos. May I look at the photos?

434
00:24:29,667 --> 00:24:31,433
- Of course.
- Yeah.

435
00:24:33,533 --> 00:24:35,067
