- No, thanks.

436
00:24:35,067 --> 00:24:36,900
Where is this place?

437
00:24:36,900 --> 00:24:41,400
Oh, that's our second house in Pyeongon-dong.

438
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:44,967
The night sky there is absolutely beautiful.

439
00:24:44,967 --> 00:24:46,733
That sounds beautiful.

440
00:24:46,733 --> 00:24:48,833
Does your family have a second house?

441
00:24:48,833 --> 00:24:50,967
Oh, a second house...

442
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:55,033
We're actually looking into getting one.

443
00:24:55,033 --> 00:24:57,367
Oh, really? Where?

444
00:24:57,367 --> 00:24:59,567
It's so nice to see.

445
00:24:59,567 --> 00:25:01,733
[2023 International Innovation Support]
Noblesse oblige.

446
00:25:01,733 --> 00:25:05,833
I see your family goes on
volunteer trips together too.

447
00:25:05,833 --> 00:25:07,433
Yeah.

448
00:25:08,833 --> 00:25:10,633
Min Seo is such a sweetheart.

449
00:25:10,633 --> 00:25:12,900
Min Seo has such a pretty face,

450
00:25:12,900 --> 00:25:16,033
