how mature she is for her age.

451
00:25:16,033 --> 00:25:19,200
But who is the person next to Min Seo?

452
00:25:20,233 --> 00:25:21,833
I guess it's Min Seo's grandmother, huh?

453
00:25:21,833 --> 00:25:25,400
No, she's a friend of my father's.

454
00:25:25,400 --> 00:25:27,600
Her name is Michelle Jung.

455
00:25:27,600 --> 00:25:29,696
She joins us for our foundation's
volunteer work every year

456
00:25:29,696 --> 00:25:32,133
