463
00:25:56,467 --> 00:25:58,667
A meal sounds great.

464
00:25:59,933 --> 00:26:03,100
She's a wonderful person.
She does a lot of volunteer work too.

465
00:26:03,100 --> 00:26:07,067
I've known her since I was young,
so to me, she's practically family.

466
00:26:07,067 --> 00:26:08,700
Oh, I see.

467
00:26:08,700 --> 00:26:11,633
Aunt Michelle even
