468
00:26:11,633 --> 00:26:13,233
Jeez...

469
00:26:15,567 --> 00:26:18,333
Still, she's still a good person.

470
00:26:18,333 --> 00:26:19,933
Yes.

471
00:26:29,000 --> 00:26:33,733
Anyway, you two look so happy together.

472
00:26:33,733 --> 00:26:36,233
