487
00:27:12,700 --> 00:27:14,600
- Are you okay?
- Yeah.

488
00:27:50,967 --> 00:27:54,333
This place is practically a maze.

489
00:28:01,167 --> 00:28:02,733
- What?
- Are you okay?

490
00:28:02,733 --> 00:28:05,200
- Huh?
- Why are you coming out from there?

491
00:28:06,133 --> 00:28:08,133
I cut my hand earlier.

492
00:28:08,133 --> 00:28:09,933
Jeez, let me see.

493
00:28:09,933 --> 00:28:11,933
Oh, seriously...

494
00:28:11,933 --> 00:28:14,467
- I'm fine.
- You're so clumsy.

495
00:28:14,467 --> 00:28:16,000
- You even cut your hand earlier?
- Yeah.

496
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:18,100
- That's a pretty deep cut.
- It's fine.

497
00:28:18,100 --> 00:28:20,767
- Oh, this is...
- Oh, right.

498
00:28:20,767 --> 00:28:25,800
I'll arrange a meeting with Aunt Michelle.

499
00:28:32,033 --> 00:28:35,567
We should help each other out.
We're neighbors, after all.

500
00:28:39,367 --> 00:28:43,033
That would be wonderful if you could.

501
00:28:43,033 --> 00:28:45,967
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

502
00:28:45,967 --> 00:28:49,300
You guys play golf too, right?

503
00:28:50,633 --> 00:28:53,267
Oh, golf? Of course.

504
00:28:53,267 --> 00:28:55,633
I only started playing recently,

505
00:28:55,633 --> 00:28:58,300
but I've really gotten into golf...

506
00:29:01,200 --> 00:29:02,267
Good shot!

507
00:29:02,267 --> 00:29:04,267
Nice on!

508
00:29:04,267 --> 00:29:07,300
- Good shot!
- Oh, good shot, good shot!

509
00:29:07,300 --> 00:29:10,733
Thank you. I made that great shot
thanks to you, Chairwoman.

510
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:29,200
Hi, Min Seo.

511
00:29:29,200 --> 00:29:31,467
Good morning.

512
00:29:31,467 --> 00:29:34,133
Connecting Ye Ji's CarPlay.

513
00:29:36,100 --> 00:29:37,567
Okay, let's go.

514
00:29:37,567 --> 00:29:39,167
Okay.

515
00:29:48,333 --> 00:29:50,333
Oh, hello.

516
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:13,067
