517
00:30:13,067 --> 00:30:18,600
[Real Estate Purchase Agreement]

518
00:30:26,267 --> 00:30:30,500
[Ye Ji's Family]

519
00:30:31,333 --> 00:30:34,467
Wow, but this place really is nice.

520
00:30:34,467 --> 00:30:37,333
- You like it? You do, Hong?
- Yeah.

521
00:30:37,333 --> 00:30:38,867
