551
00:32:45,800 --> 00:32:50,033
Oh my, good job, Jae Hong.

552
00:32:50,033 --> 00:32:51,467
You did a great job.

553
00:32:51,467 --> 00:32:54,067
Huh? What is this? Why is it so comfortable?

554
00:32:54,067 --> 00:32:56,833
- Did you change the sofa, honey?
- Yeah. It's good, right?

555
00:32:56,833 --> 00:32:59,533
I replaced it because
Chairwoman Jung is coming over.

556
00:32:59,533 --> 00:33:02,333
The fabric is authentic,
so it feels different from other sofas.

557
00:33:02,333 --> 00:33:05,267
Oh, really? What is this, velvet?
It's incredibly soft.

558
00:33:05,267 --> 00:33:06,467
- The color is amazing, isn't it?
- Yeah.

559
00:33:06,467 --> 00:33:09,000
Ye Ji, feel this. It's totally soft.

560
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:11,367
That's the one we featured in our content.

561
00:33:11,367 --> 00:33:13,067
And it was a huge hit.

562
00:33:13,067 --> 00:33:15,767
Oh, the brand that sold out
right away last time?

563
00:33:15,767 --> 00:33:18,067
- Yeah, that one.
- No wonder.

564
00:33:18,067 --> 00:33:20,700
Wow, the color is perfect
for our vacation home.

565
00:33:20,700 --> 00:33:21,733
We made a great choice, honey.

566
00:33:21,733 --> 00:33:23,467
- Of course, I have good taste.
- Crew members!

567
00:33:23,467 --> 00:33:24,700
We are truly so grateful.

568
00:33:24,700 --> 00:33:26,033
But seriously,

569
00:33:26,033 --> 00:33:27,667
- you're playing that?
- We will truly live well!

570
00:33:27,667 --> 00:33:29,333
Then what should we play?

571
00:33:29,333 --> 00:33:31,400
This one made our views explode.

572
00:33:31,400 --> 00:33:33,400
This one and the video of us

573
00:33:33,400 --> 00:33:36,833
