in our rooftop room when she was a baby.

574
00:33:36,833 --> 00:33:39,367
If we play these
and subtly show our subscribers

575
00:33:39,367 --> 00:33:41,600
why they love our content so much,

576
00:33:41,600 --> 00:33:44,567
and hint at how close our family is...

577
00:33:44,567 --> 00:33:47,067
Then we'll finally get them
to sign the deal today, right?

578
00:33:47,067 --> 00:33:48,533
We have to get it stamped. Please!

579
00:33:48,533 --> 00:33:50,400
Seriously, it's been months already!

580
00:33:50,400 --> 00:33:53,800
She keeps complaining about everything
and saying she may or may not give us money.

581
00:33:53,800 --> 00:33:56,733
I'm so done with that old woman, seriously.

582
00:33:56,733 --> 00:33:58,567
I mean, let's be honest.
Isn't this just abuse of power?

583
00:33:58,567 --> 00:34:00,500
Of course it is. She's taking it
to a whole other level.

584
00:34:00,500 --> 00:34:04,267
I mean, she went through all
the company records and financial reports,

585
00:34:04,267 --> 00:34:09,333
and said she'd only sign off
after making sure our family was doing well.

586
00:34:09,333 --> 00:34:11,700
Such a know-it-all. A total old-school idiot.

587
00:34:12,333 --> 00:34:14,000
- Seriously...
- She should be here soon.

588
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:15,700
She's such a difficult person
to deal with, seriously.

589
00:34:15,700 --> 00:34:19,000
Who set this table so beautifully?

590
00:34:23,567 --> 00:34:25,433
[A new message has arrived]

591
00:34:25,433 --> 00:34:28,367
Didn't you say that old lady
hates people being late?

592
00:34:28,367 --> 00:34:31,133
I know, right? This never happens.

593
00:34:32,400 --> 00:34:35,067
Could she have gotten into
an accident on the way here? Seriously?

594
00:34:37,233 --> 00:34:40,967
We need to eat this before it gets cold.

595
00:34:41,600 --> 00:34:45,833
Ye Ji, you're hungry, right? Here, have some.

596
00:34:45,833 --> 00:34:47,000
I'm fine.

597
00:34:47,000 --> 00:34:49,567
Why? Look, I'm eating it.

598
00:34:49,567 --> 00:34:51,167
Huh?

599
00:34:51,167 --> 00:34:52,567
A red heart?

600
00:34:52,567 --> 00:34:54,967
What's this? What's this?

601
00:34:54,967 --> 00:34:57,800
Ye Ji, do you have a boyfriend?

602
00:34:57,800 --> 00:35:00,700
What are you talking about?
It's not like that.

603
00:35:00,700 --> 00:35:02,600
Don't lie. You...

604
00:35:02,600 --> 00:35:05,300
You... You can't lie to me.

605
00:35:06,100 --> 00:35:10,267
Huh? This is a couple ring, right?

606
00:35:10,267 --> 00:35:11,400
Ye Ji!

607
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:13,800
Didn't I tell you to tell me right away
if you got a boyfriend?

608
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:16,067
It's not my boyfriend!

609
00:35:16,067 --> 00:35:19,767
What do you mean it's not?
You... You can't lie, alright?

610
00:35:21,667 --> 00:35:23,367
What is it?

611
00:35:24,667 --> 00:35:28,433
I can't believe someone
actually wants to buy this.

612
00:35:28,433 --> 00:35:30,300
Wow, seriously...

613
00:35:31,533 --> 00:35:35,233
Lim Ye Ji, you have to be
honest with me, okay?

614
00:35:37,967 --> 00:35:40,267
[It would be nice if we could eat together]
Is a delivery transaction okay?

615
00:35:40,267 --> 00:35:42,533
[Actually, what I really want is...]

616
00:35:42,533 --> 00:35:46,267
[You know it's you, right?]

617
00:35:46,267 --> 00:35:48,100
[Gogo Used Market SOO]

618
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:51,133
I trust Jae Hong...

619
00:35:51,133 --> 00:35:53,567
I trust Eun Bin.

620
00:35:53,567 --> 00:35:57,767
Don't tell me you believe that rumor
about "Cheating Husband A".

621
00:35:57,767 --> 00:36:01,100
Chairwoman Jung doesn't
actually believe that, right?

622
00:36:01,767 --> 00:36:02,880
Just come over first.

623
00:36:02,880 --> 00:36:04,800
Once you see us together,
you'll understand right away.

624
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:08,833
Ms. Park, I don't think meeting today
will lead to a positive outcome.

625
00:36:08,833 --> 00:36:11,133
Mr. Ha!

626
00:36:11,133 --> 00:36:14,933
We've already informed our new clients,

627
00:36:14,933 --> 00:36:17,467
and we've expanded our factory production
and placed orders.

628
00:36:17,467 --> 00:36:20,567
You know everything has been
scheduled around the investment date.

629
00:36:20,567 --> 00:36:23,700
But saying you're pulling
out of the investment now

630
00:36:23,700 --> 00:36:26,133
just doesn't make sense.

631
00:36:26,133 --> 00:36:29,200
Honestly, the appeal of the ZiP brand

632
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:31,333
comes entirely from your fame

633
00:36:31,333 --> 00:36:34,200
and the seemingly perfect family image.

634
00:36:34,200 --> 00:36:37,900
But if your husband has been
out there having affairs...

635
00:36:37,900 --> 00:36:40,233
Let's just wait and see for now.

636
00:36:40,233 --> 00:36:41,400
Mr. Ha!

637
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:43,800
You've probably had a long day today,

638
00:36:43,800 --> 00:36:48,000
so just think of this as a family
spending some quality time together.

639
00:36:48,833 --> 00:36:50,933
Then, I'll hang up.

640
00:37:13,367 --> 00:37:16,133
This is so darn frustrating.

641
00:37:36,667 --> 00:37:39,300
[Ryu Ji Su and Cheating Husband A,
From the drama "Townhouse," Mr. Cha]

642
00:37:39,300 --> 00:37:40,500
[Apparently, the set of the daily drama
"Townhouse" has been in chaos lately]

643
00:37:40,500 --> 00:37:42,400
[Rumors say married actor A
is seeing co-star Ryu Ji Su]

644
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:45,767
[Controversial past interview,
Ryu Ji Su's past remarks resurface]

645
00:37:45,767 --> 00:37:49,867
Ms. Ryu Ji Su, here's
a surprise question for you.

646
00:37:49,867 --> 00:37:55,167
What kind of person are you attracted to?

647
00:37:56,367 --> 00:37:58,333
- I...
- Yeah.

648
00:37:58,333 --> 00:38:01,400
- Someone I can respect?
- Respect...

649
00:38:01,400 --> 00:38:04,667
So I'm drawn to people who work hard on set.

650
00:38:04,667 --> 00:38:06,300
Oh, really?

651
00:38:06,300 --> 00:38:08,544
[Past interview controversy]
So would you say you feel

652
00:38:08,544 --> 00:38:11,000
that kind of attraction toward fellow actors?

653
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:12,367
Well...

654
00:38:12,367 --> 00:38:14,033
This is...

655
00:38:23,167 --> 00:38:26,967
[Pattern entered incorrectly]

656
00:38:40,867 --> 00:38:43,133
[Ryu Ji Su]

657
00:38:43,133 --> 00:38:44,733
[I had so much fun working with you]

658
00:38:44,733 --> 00:38:48,467
[I enjoyed it too, thanks to you, Ji Su.
Let's meet up sometime. Dinner's on me]

659
00:39:06,067 --> 00:39:11,733
Honey, you know, about Ye Ji...

660
00:39:12,567 --> 00:39:16,267
I think she might have gotten a boyfriend.

661
00:39:16,267 --> 00:39:19,533
I mean, I happened to see her phone earlier
while you were on the phone,

662
00:39:19,533 --> 00:39:23,567
and the contact name
had a heart on it, a red heart at that.

663
00:39:27,833 --> 00:39:29,800
Are you cheating on me?

664
00:39:30,633 --> 00:39:32,300
What?

665
00:39:32,933 --> 00:39:35,733
Jeez, no, what?

666
00:39:35,733 --> 00:39:38,733
What are you talking about all of a sudden?

667
00:39:38,733 --> 00:39:41,833
[Ryu Ji Su and Cheating Husband A,
From the drama "Townhouse," Mr. Cha]

668
00:39:41,833 --> 00:39:44,000
What... What is this?

669
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:45,833
Huh?

670
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:55,033
Seriously... what is this?

671
00:39:55,033 --> 00:39:58,400
Honey, you don't actually
believe this, do you?

672
00:39:58,400 --> 00:40:01,267
I'm telling you, it's not true.

673
00:40:01,267 --> 00:40:05,233
I mean, what's this about Ryu Ji Su
all of a sudden? This is ridiculous.

674
00:40:05,233 --> 00:40:08,367
I mean, it's true that
I'm close with Ryu Ji Su,

675
00:40:08,367 --> 00:40:11,200
but you were the one who told me
to get close to Ryu Ji Su!

676
00:40:11,200 --> 00:40:12,900
Don't you remember?

677
00:40:13,900 --> 00:40:15,933
Seriously.

678
00:40:15,933 --> 00:40:19,900
Honey! I'm really hurt.

679
00:40:20,967 --> 00:40:22,467
Jeez.

680
00:40:22,467 --> 00:40:25,167
Wow, but this is really ridiculous.

681
00:40:25,167 --> 00:40:29,033
I can't believe I'm caught up
in a scandal at my age.

682
00:40:29,033 --> 00:40:31,300
I guess I've really made it big.

683
00:40:33,833 --> 00:40:35,328
Yeah.

684
00:40:36,064 --> 00:40:39,267
I told him to get close to Ryu Ji Su.

685
00:40:39,267 --> 00:40:41,367
Yeah.

686
00:40:41,367 --> 00:40:44,667
And my picture was right next to hers
in that dermatology clinic photo.

687
00:40:44,667 --> 00:40:48,667
Right? Anyway, what do we do
about Michelle Jung?

688
00:40:48,667 --> 00:40:50,600
What else can we do?

689
00:40:50,600 --> 00:40:54,100
We'll try approaching her again
once the rumors die down.

690
00:40:54,100 --> 00:40:57,200
Director Kwak, make sure this doesn't
get blown out of proportion in the news.

691
00:40:57,200 --> 00:40:58,567
- Got it.
- Hello!

692
00:40:58,567 --> 00:41:02,267
Anyway, whoever wrote this garbage rumor
and left those YouTube comments

693
00:41:02,267 --> 00:41:04,667
is just making up fake eyewitness accounts
and writing their own stories.

694
00:41:04,667 --> 00:41:07,200
I'm going to sue every single one of them.

695
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:08,967
Eyewitness accounts?

696
00:41:10,167 --> 00:41:12,000
There are eyewitness accounts?

697
00:41:17,933 --> 00:41:21,333
Cut! Alright, cut, okay!

698
00:41:21,333 --> 00:41:22,867
- Did we get everything?
- Yes, we got enough.

699
00:41:22,867 --> 00:41:25,433
Captain, we've finished filming your parts.

700
00:41:25,433 --> 00:41:27,567
We'll just get some insert shots and move on.

701
00:41:27,567 --> 00:41:29,467
Good work.

702
00:41:30,967 --> 00:41:32,167
What's left?

703
00:41:32,167 --> 00:41:34,433
The breaker and the hammer.
We just need the hammer shot.

704
00:41:34,433 --> 00:41:35,600
I told you I shot that earlier.

705
00:41:35,600 --> 00:41:37,767
Yeah, but we can't use that.

706
00:41:40,100 --> 00:41:43,767
- Shouldn't we shoot this too?
- Sure.

707
00:41:49,833 --> 00:41:51,900
[I live in the same officetel as Ryu,
see them together often, have photo]

708
00:41:51,900 --> 00:41:53,900
[I came here after seeing
the rumor. Is it true?]

709
00:41:57,867 --> 00:42:03,133
[Real-time: Mr. Cha and Ms. Ryu
spotted in Hanram-dong]

710
00:42:04,367 --> 00:42:08,667
[A photo of Ryu J.S.
with a man in Hanram-dong]

711
00:42:39,833 --> 00:42:42,233
[@Chastaryobb_ Love today's outfit]

712
00:42:51,100 --> 00:42:53,600
[Ryu Ji Su, bye:
She's currently having an affair]

713
00:43:33,133 --> 00:43:35,033
Captain.

714
00:43:35,033 --> 00:43:38,167
Captain! Captain! Are you okay?

715
00:43:38,167 --> 00:43:40,767
- Are you alright?
- Are you hurt?

716
00:43:42,967 --> 00:43:45,133
C-Captain, that...

717
00:43:45,133 --> 00:43:46,767
Wait...

718
00:44:10,767 --> 00:44:12,400
[Mini GPS Tracker]

719
00:44:53,400 --> 00:44:55,500
[Resident Registration Card, Lim Jae Hong]

720
00:45:00,500 --> 00:45:02,833
- Hello.
- Why are you sitting here? You startled me.

721
00:45:02,833 --> 00:45:04,867
- Have you eaten?
- Yes, I have.

722
00:45:04,867 --> 00:45:06,233
- Let's go!
- Okay.

723
00:45:06,233 --> 00:45:08,833
You said you were going to
the dermatologist after filming, right?

724
00:45:08,833 --> 00:45:10,667
Yeah.

725
00:45:10,667 --> 00:45:13,400
What time do you think you'll wrap up?

726
00:45:14,167 --> 00:45:16,767
Probably around seven?

727
00:45:16,767 --> 00:45:19,733
Oh, but I was planning to meet
the director briefly after we're done.

728
00:45:19,733 --> 00:45:21,333
Why?

729
00:45:21,333 --> 00:45:24,733
Nothing. It's your first commercial, honey.

730
00:45:24,733 --> 00:45:26,867
I thought we could have dinner together
to celebrate.

731
00:45:26,867 --> 00:45:28,500
Oh... really?

732
00:45:28,500 --> 00:45:31,467
But what should I do?
I might be a little late.

733
00:45:31,467 --> 00:45:33,867
I'll try to wrap up as early as I can.

734
00:45:33,867 --> 00:45:35,400
- Thanks, honey!
- Good luck with filming.

735
00:45:35,400 --> 00:45:37,200
Yeah, thanks.

736
00:45:38,067 --> 00:45:39,733
I'll call you later.

737
00:45:47,933 --> 00:45:50,867
Director, well...

738
00:45:50,867 --> 00:45:53,767
About Jae Hong...

739
00:45:57,300 --> 00:46:01,067
I mean, at the clinic, Ryu Ji...

740
00:46:03,267 --> 00:46:06,067
